  greetings:
  - Ruth's not here.
  - What do you want.
  aboutSelf: Farmed this land forty years. Ruth's visiting her sister. In Tulsa.
  aboutTown: Leave the town be.
  seenAnythingStrange: Nothing strange here. Nothing.
  foundersDay: Rained. Ruth made her rhubarb pie. Lost to Mae's cherry. She always loses to Mae.
  gossip:
  - title: About Ruth Calder
    response: Ruth's fine. She writes. ...She'll write.
  - title: About Father Crane
    response: Crane's head's sat crooked since he was a boy. Leans right, like he's listening at a door.
